== 1 per-document noise s = SE*sqrt(docs) and q = s/|log r| (pairs 0.5% <= |log r| <= 15%; move1 = a 3.00 -> 3.50 group move vs V2 3.00, move2 = two disjoint group moves (a swap-like pair), c / x = other pairs)
  move1 pairs   12  |log r| median 4.55%  s median 0.044 [IQR 0.041-0.059]  q median 0.98 [IQR 0.76-1.26]
  move2 pairs   55  |log r| median 2.20%  s median 0.069 [IQR 0.056-0.086]  q median 2.94 [IQR 1.62-5.93]
