  x     pairs  133  |log r| median 2.59%  s median 0.168 [IQR 0.095-0.254]  q median 7.18 [IQR 2.96-11.15]
  x / c per-document noise on the same pair (27d-f, 87 pairs): median 1.93  IQR 0.95-2.24
